        {
            "id": "20260924A0AKBU00",
            "title": "干货收藏！境内/出境/自驾，保险怎么选？怎么买不踩坑？",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/ONojMTLz1reknHqahJ2Y1cHv35unfstDgMY8OubJ_QxlAAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260924A0AKBU00",
            "author": "初露锋芒",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-24 15:25:45",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">距离中秋、国庆双节越来越近，以“<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">请3休13</span></span></span>”拼出的超长假期，推动境内游、自驾游、户外露营、出境游需求集中释放。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">伴随出行人数攀升，旅途意外受伤、航班变更、异地就医等风险随之增多，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">旅行保险</span></span></span>成为不少消费者出行前的选择。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">面对市场上种类繁多的保险产品，消费者该如何选、怎么赔？</span><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">《金融时报》</span><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">记者采访保险业内人士，为大家假期出游梳理一份清晰的投保与理赔指南。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 122, 170);font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\">节前保险需求热度提早释放</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">今年</span><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">中秋与国庆间隔较短，超长假期拉长了大众出游周期，也带动旅行保险需求提前启动。<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">慧择</span></span></span>保险经纪财产险产品负责人<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">刘甜</span></span></span>告诉记者，受中秋与国庆超长假期影响，</span><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">今年</span><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">大众出行规模更大、行程更远。相关保险咨询在出行前两三周就开始增加，咨询启动时点不仅早于往年同期，咨询量也高于普通周末、短期小长假。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">与此同时，投保量也稳中有升。投保增量主要集中在三类场景：</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:bold\">一是境内户外，消费者关注<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">高风险运动</span></span></span>扩展、意外医疗、急性病医疗；</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:bold\">二是出境游，关注境外医疗保额、医疗垫付、紧急救援、航班延误与取消、行程阻碍变更；</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:bold\">三是自驾游，关注驾乘意外、道路救援、第三者责任。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">从<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">腾讯</span></span></span>微保平台的投保数据来看，用户通过微信等线上渠道获取保障的偏好日益增强，旅行险相关咨询量与投保量呈现明显上扬态势。腾讯微保有关负责人表示，微保的“<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">群投保</span></span></span>”功能获得了用户的广泛认可，旅行险拼团单量增长明显。可以看出，“说走就走”的出行方式正倒逼投保流程变得更加轻便、快捷，线上化、社交化的投保已成为主流趋势。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 122, 170);font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\">不同出行场景保险怎么选</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">买哪种保险，取决于旅行目的地、游玩项目及出行方式。受访人士建议消费者，根据具体出行场景的差异化风险点来配置保险。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">如果选择境内普通出游，建议购买境内旅行险，</span>重点关注意外伤害、医疗补偿，以及行程取消或延误等风险保障。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">如果选择境外游，建议购买境外旅行险，</span>按目的地签证要求、医疗水平配置投保保额，重点关注紧急救援服务、境外住院医疗垫付服务，同时关注行李证件损失、旅行变更、航班延误等实用保障。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">如果选择自驾游，</span>除了基础旅行险外，建议购买<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">综合交通意外险</span></span></span>，为自驾出行中可能遇到的车辆意外、人身伤害提供更全面的保障。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">特别需要注意的是，登山、骑行、潜水、漂流等户外活动，在多数旅行险条款中被归入“高风险运动”并予以免责。因此，若旅行中规划了相关运动，需要购买覆盖多种常见高风险运动项目的旅行保险，并确认是否包含急性病医疗、紧急救援服务。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\">投保做到“三看”避免踩坑</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">从市场反馈来看，消费者投保旅行保险存在三类较为集中的认知误区：</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">一是误以为投保即可立即生效，忽视保单生效时间；</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">二是忽视<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">免责条款</span></span></span>，不清楚既往症、高风险运动等情形往往不在保障范围内；</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">三是对就医、用药的保单限定缺乏认知，出险后才发现就诊机构不符合理赔要求。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">针对上述常见问题，业内人士提醒消费者，投保旅行保险要做到“三看”：</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">一看保单生效时间，</span>多数旅行保险最早支持次日零时生效，出发当天投保会存在保障“真空期”，务必提前规划，确保保障能无缝覆盖整个行程；</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">二看免责条款，</span>厘清既往症、高风险运动等除外责任，避免后续发生理赔争议；</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">三看就医与用药范围，</span>保单通常要求二级及以上公立医院、社保范围内用药等规则，提前知悉医院等级与用药限制，保障出险后可以顺利理赔。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">此外，旅行保险“保额是不是越高越好”也是消费者非常关注的问题。刘甜表示，保额并非越高越好，关键要看保障责任是否与行程相匹配。境内短途出游，医疗险保额5万元基本够用；出境游看目的地签证要求和医疗费用水平。同时，还需留意医疗费用的赔付约定，优先选择“<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">0免赔、100%赔付</span></span></span>”的保险产品。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">也有消费者疑惑，已经购买了意外险或者车险，还用买旅行保险吗？刘甜解释称，两者都不能完全替代旅行保险。年缴的综合意外险虽可覆盖部分意外医疗费用，但高风险运动、急性病医疗、紧急救援、旅行变更、行李损失等保障，往往更贴合旅行使用场景。车险则不保车上人员人伤的全额医疗费用。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 122, 170);font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\">出行遇险如何顺畅理赔</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">节假日出行集中，相关保险理赔进入高发期。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">慧择保险经纪客户服务中心总经理左申洋告诉记者，结合过往大量出险案件来看，理赔纠纷大多不是因为“赔不了”，而是流程没走对、证据没留全。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">左申洋提示，<!-- -->一旦发生事故，首要原则是优先救人，并且尽量在24小时内报案，做好现场证据固定。就医时要向医生如实描述意外伤情，完整保管全套医疗资料。陈述事故经过务必客观真实，不虚构信息，以降低理赔争议风险。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">上述腾讯微保有关负责人提醒，车辆出险，先确保人身安全，再对现场拍照取证，务必在条款规定的时限内报案。若涉及人伤或较大金额损失，需由交警出具事故认定书，理赔时应先定损再维修，切忌先修后赔。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:24px;margin-top:24px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">记者了解到，目前绝大多数保险公司及保险中介平台都开通了线上理赔通道，消费者可通过微信小程序、App直接提交理赔申请材料，理赔进度可实时查询。</span></p><blockquote style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-left:3px solid rgb(219, 219, 219);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.4352px;margin:1em 0px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:4px 0px 0px 10px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0em;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:1;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><section data-nest-level=\"6\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.498);font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 8px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mogw8g6222at\" data-nest-level=\"7\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;color:rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.544px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-indent:0em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-nest-level=\"8\" mpa-font-style=\"moz7l3ap218s\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-nest-level=\"9\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">来源：金融时报客户端</span></span></span></span></section><section data-nest-level=\"6\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.498);font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 8px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mogw8g6222at\" data-nest-level=\"7\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;color:rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.544px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-indent:0em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-nest-level=\"8\" mpa-font-style=\"moz7l3ap218s\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-nest-level=\"9\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">记者</span></span><span data-nest-level=\"9\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">：</span></span><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">戴梦希</span></span></span></span></section><section data-nest-level=\"6\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.498);font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 8px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-nest-level=\"7\" mpa-font-style=\"moz7l3apuha\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-indent:0em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">编辑：郑澜新</span></span></span></section></blockquote></div>",
