            "description": "<div id=\"article-content\"><div class=\"article-top-content\"><div class=\"ac-ask-ai\" style=\"--ac-ask-yuanbao-icon-default:url('https://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_bt/0/0318120013369_320/0')\"><div class=\"ac-ask-ai-left\"><span class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-icon\"></span><div class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-content\"><span class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-content-ask\">问AI</span><span> · </span><span class=\"ac-ask-ai-left-content-text\">不愿躺平首位女财务总监转顾问谋何新篇？</span></div></div><svg class=\"ruyi-icon ruyi-icon-chevron-right-regular\" height=\"24\" id=\"chevron-right-regular\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M9 5L16 12L9 19\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></g></svg></div></div><div class=\"comps-contentify-wrap comps-contentify-pc-wrap\"><div class=\"qnt-p\">汇丰CFO郭珮瑛明年卸任，但不会退休。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">离任原因：62岁的她干了快两年，是汇丰160年来首位女CFO。她自己说不是那种想躺平的人，以后还会接着找领导岗位干。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">后续安排：正式交接前，她会先转做顾问帮一把手搞策略项目。这活儿会一直干到2028年底。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\">继任人选：汇丰已经在找接班人，内部提拔和外部空降都在考虑。</div><div class=\"qnt-p\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OAYMcd8DFBQMqkOySp2co_PJKEwCHO2sjr24duWZRrHOcAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OAYMcd8DFBQMqkOySp2co_PJKEwCHO2sjr24duWZRrHOcAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;height:100%\"/></div></div></div>",
